{"sourceUrl":"https://ctt.swjtu.edu.cn/info/4321/219681.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:25.237300+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ctt.swjtu.edu.cn/info/4321/219681.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><span><span>西南交通大学交通运输与物流学院热忱欢迎全国各地优秀大学生通过推荐免试方式攻读我院研究生。为做好</span><span>202</span></span><span>6</span><span>年推荐免试研究生工作，我院将于</span><span>202</span><span>5</span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span>1</span><span>1日至9月</span><span>16</span><span>日</span><span>期间进行推免生意向征集工作，现将具体事项做如下说明：</span></p><p><strong><span>推免生招生专业</span></strong><span>：</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span>序号</span></p></td><td><p><span>学位类别</span></p></td><td><p><span>专业代码</span></p></td><td><p><span>专业名称</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>1</span></p></td><td><p><span>学术型硕士</span></p></td><td><p><span>071100</span></p></td><td><p><span>系统科学</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>2</span></p></td><td><p><span>学术型硕士</span></p></td><td><p><span>082303</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>交通运输规划与管理</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>3</span></p></td><td><p><span>学术型硕士</span></p></td><td><p><span>0823Z1</span></p></td><td><p><span>物流工程</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>4</span></p></td><td><p><span>学术型硕士</span></p></td><td><p><span>0823Z2</span></p></td><td><p><span>交通工程</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>5</span></p></td><td><p><span>学术型硕士</span></p></td><td><p><span>083700</span></p></td><td><p><span>安全科学与工程</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>6</span></p></td><td><p><span>专业型硕士</span></p></td><td><p><span>08570</span><span>2</span></p></td><td><p><span>安全工程</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>7</span></p></td><td><p><span>专业型硕士</span></p></td><td><p><span>086100</span></p></td><td><p><span>交通运输</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>8</span></p></td><td><p><span>专业型硕士</span></p></td><td><p><span>125604</span></p></td><td><p><span>物流工程与管理</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong><span>注：意向专业选择</span></strong><strong><span>082303</span></strong><strong><span><span>交通运输规划与管理</span></span></strong><strong><span>和</span></strong><strong><span>086100交通运输</span></strong><strong><span>的学生需在征集表中选择研究方向</span></strong><strong><span>。</span></strong></p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong><span>征集范围：</span></strong></p><p><span>已获得</span><span>本科</span><span>就读学校推荐免试资格，且</span><span>有强烈意愿攻读</span><span>我院免试研究生的优秀应届本科毕业生可参加本次意向征集（含</span><span>本校及</span><span>本院学生）</span><span>。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span>流程：</span></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><span>意向征集工作通过我院提供的网址或二维码完成，填报</span><span>申请</span><span>“西南交通大学交通运输与物流学院202</span><span>6</span><span>年推免生意向征集</span><span>表</span><span>”</span><span>，</span><span>并加入</span><strong><span><span>QQ</span><span>群：1051172404</span></span></strong><strong><span>。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>截止时间：</span><span>202</span></span></strong><strong><span>5</span></strong><strong><span>-09-</span></strong><strong><span>16上</span></strong><strong><span>午</span></strong><strong><span>9</span></strong><strong><span>:00，时间截止链接自动关闭。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>填报</span></strong><strong><span>网址</span></strong><strong><span>及二维码</span></strong><strong><span>：<br/><a href=\"https://wj.qq.com/s2/23815110/591e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://wj.qq.com/s2/23815110/591e/</a><br/></span></strong></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ctt.swjtu.edu.cn/__local/5/D7/57/7921230B646D2C674F508648600_B7C753E4_7FF5D.png\"/></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><span>2.参与意向征集的同学须如实填写，并按要求提交</span><strong><span>PDF格式</span></strong><span>简历及证明材料。</span><span>提供的信息和有关材料须真实有效，凡发现弄虚作假者，一切后果自行承担。</span><span>所有信息以该时间段内最后一次信息为准</span><span>，</span><strong><span>请勿重复填报</span></strong><span>。时间截止后，所有信息不可更改。</span></p><p><span>3.学院对参与意向征集的同学所提供的信息进行审核，请填写好正确的联系电话和邮箱信息，</span><span>保持联络方式畅通，</span><span>以方便学院联系。后续安排请密切关注学院官网通知。</span></p><p><strong><span>办公咨询电话</span></strong><span><span>：</span><span>028-66365983（陈老师）</span></span></p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong><span>温馨提醒：</span></strong></p><p><span><span>在教育部规定时间内通过教育部</span><span>“全国推荐优秀应届本科生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统” （简称推免服务系统，网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/ ）完成最终的报名及接收程序。凡被我校接收的推免同学，由学校通过“推免服务系统”发布待录取通知，学生收到录取通知后，须在规定时间内通过“推免服务系统”确认录取。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>                                                       <span>交通运输与物流学院</span></span></p><p><span>                                                        <span>2025年9月11日</span></span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"0464cff33e37c7fd645d66cff364a1d256f41e76732659c8f9ecb7d79a324a50","textLength":939,"sourceSha256":"a2c21ea54d3834ee37d420f52ca803ce3c139fcfc41123b458ea2040aa78a3fb","selector":".v_news_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-0e7aa421f307b92cc843","title":"2025年西南交通大学交通运输与物流学院2026年推免生意向征集的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:25.237300+00:00"}
